# Next.js

- Cache Components is on: no `export const dynamic` / `revalidate`, no `unstable_cache`. Check APIs in `apps/web/node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.
- Request reads (`params`, `searchParams`, `cookies()`, `headers()`, session) go inside `<Suspense>`; nothing request-bound inside `'use cache'`.
- After a write: `updateTag` for the actor, `revalidateTag(tag, "max")` for others, tags from `cache-tags.ts`.

Guide: [docs/agents/nextjs.md](docs/agents/nextjs.md)
